# Append this as its OWN site block to the VPS's existing Caddyfile
# (/home/chowmesadmin/Caddyfile, currently fronting AC2's ac2-lab-backend at
# judge.contentengagement.info among other sites — see phase-5
# deploy-design.md for why ACS gets a separate subdomain instead of reusing
# that one).
#
# NOT applied automatically by anything in this repo — Caddy's live config
# on a shared production VPS is out of scope for an automated agent to edit.
# Applied once, by hand, then `caddy reload`.
#
# Pick a real subdomain before use — "acs-judge" below is a placeholder.

acs-judge.contentengagement.info {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8788
}
